comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-22T10:05:21.251Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: full all-status corpus and keyword/hybrid dogfood telemetry cleanup searches inspected. Closed pm-14dnbh added synchronous cleanup but did not prevent detached workers from recreating roots. This distinct observed defect has a preserved reproduction from the current 89-command acceptance run."
  "2026-09-22T10:08:28.660Z","harness:codex","TDD and real acceptance evidence: the existing success-path regression failed before implementation when PM_TELEMETRY_DISABLED=0 was inherited. After explicitly disabling telemetry for synthetic child commands, all 39 unit cases pass and the real 89-command package-first journey passes with its temporary root absent after process completion. Production telemetry is verified separately by the required live gate; no production setting is changed."
  "2026-09-22T10:35:46.313Z","harness:codex","Final source verification: all 9202 tests passed with exact 100/100/100/100 coverage. PM-linked regressions, build, typecheck, source/lint/duplicate/contracts/docs gates, packed npx/bunx, previous-version compatibility and real temporary-project CLI/SDK acceptance passed. The live Sentry/telemetry reliability gate passed. Local cold-start timing failures under host contention are preserved in pm-xjy565; the unchanged hosted static gate must pass before merge. Closure is part of the reviewed delivery; publication and merged-head verification are separate checks."
